# Repository-wide line-ending policy.
#
# Two things here break outright under a CRLF checkout on Windows:
#
#   - signer/wordlist/english.txt is verified against the SHA-256 published
#     with BIP-39. CRLF changes every line and the hash test fails.
#   - registry/conformance/ diffs generated output against a checked-in
#     fixture. CRLF makes every line differ.
#
# Neither is a style preference, so pin LF for everything textual.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wasm binary
